URL:https://www.phcl.org/events/interactive-fun-storytelling-3-2026-11-28/
SUMMARY:Interactive & Fun Storytelling
DESCRIPTION:With over 30 years of experience\, Tales with Tracey offers a fun and educational experience for your little ones. Each session features a well-loved children's book\, enhanced with props\, expressive character voices\, and interactive storytelling.\n\nAlongside the story\, children will enjoy singing\, rhymes\, and lively verbal exchanges that encourage them to learn new words\, improve language skills\, and boost their imagination.\n\n£3\, 11am on Saturdays.
